  "ruleText": "Agr 1805.01 Pests Honey Bees. Regulated pests shall include:\n\n(a) Africanized honey bee (Apis mellifera scutellata);\n\n(b) American foulbrood (Paenibacillus larvae); and\n\n(c) Tropilaelaps mite (Tropilaelaps spp.).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Agr 1800) #5802, eff 3-25-94, EXPIRED: 3-25-00\n\nNew. #7284, eff 5-24-00, EXPIRED: 5-24-08\n\nNew. #10586, eff 5-13-14; ss by #13978, eff 5-23-24",
